00:00:16.520 --> 00:00:18.250
Hi David.

00:00:18.250 --> 00:00:20.690
This is Dylan from North Carolina.

00:00:20.690 --> 00:00:21.690
Hey Dylan.

00:00:21.690 --> 00:00:22.690
What's going on?

00:00:22.690 --> 00:00:24.380
I'm doing pretty well.

00:00:24.380 --> 00:00:30.189
I was just thinking longterm policy, you know,
with this whole Kavanaugh situation, the Supreme

00:00:30.189 --> 00:00:35.010
court being as it is, I'm really concerned
as to what kind of new things will come down

00:00:35.010 --> 00:00:36.270
