the idea that we shouldn't even do it because

00:02:35.799 --> 00:02:38.239
the Supreme court might hear it and reverse
it.

00:02:38.239 --> 00:02:40.019
I don't think make sense whatsoever.

00:02:40.019 --> 00:02:41.019
Okay.

00:02:41.019 --> 00:02:42.019
All right.

00:02:42.019 --> 00:02:43.629
